The web midi api seems to work with everything other than sending sysex, which is the only feature of the API that requires any special conditions. Here is an example of sending sysex, which crashes the app every time:

``` javascript
navigator.requestMIDIAccess({sysex: true}).then(onMIDISuccess, onMIDIFailure);
// midi is the returned midiAccess object from requestMIDIAccess
var outputPort = midi.outputs.get(outputport.id); //loop over each output to get access to each port
